<Layout title="Home" description="Victor A. Pinto Abarzúa — Space physicist, Assistant Professor at USACH. Researcher in radiation belts, space weather, and machine learning.">

<section>
  <p class="lead">
    I am an <strong>Assistant Professor</strong> at the Department of Physics, <strong>Universidad de Santiago de Chile (USACH)</strong>, where I lead the <a href="https://heliousach.github.io" target="_blank">HelioFísica and Space Weather Research Group</a>. My research focuses on the dynamics of Earth's radiation belts, ULF waves, and the use of machine learning for space weather prediction.
  </p>

